translation.billing.chatgptConnectCta.botsTitle	Run {{botNamePlural}} on your ChatGPT plan
translation.billing.chatgptConnectCta.botsDescription	Connect your ChatGPT account so supported sessions your {{botNamePlural}} start as you draw on your ChatGPT plan.
translation.billing.chatgptConnectCta.botBudgetTitle	Keep this {{botName}} running with ChatGPT
translation.billing.chatgptConnectCta.botBudgetDescription	Connect your ChatGPT account so supported sessions it starts as you draw on your ChatGPT plan instead of this budget.
