translation.billing.increaseLimitTitle	Increase your usage limit
translation.billing.increaseOrgLimitMemberDescription	You have hit your per-organization limit for available {{unit}} this billing cycle. Organization admins can increase organization usage limit in settings.
translation.billing.increaseOrgLimitMemberEnterpriseDescription	You have hit your per-organization limit for available enterprise {{unit}} this billing cycle. Enterprise admins can increase organization usage limit in settings.
translation.billing.increaseOrgLimitOwnerDescription	You have hit your per-organization limit for available {{unit}} this billing cycle. To continue using Devin, you can increase your organization's usage limit. <learnMore>Learn more</learnMore>
translation.billing.increaseOrgLimitOwnerEnterpriseDescription	You have hit your per-organization limit for available enterprise {{unit}} this billing cycle. To continue using Devin, you can increase your organization's usage limit. <learnMore>Learn more</learnMore>
translation.billing.increaseOrgLimitTitle	Increase your organization's usage limit
translation.billing.increaseUserLimitDescription	You have hit your per-user limit for available {{unit}} this billing cycle. Request more from your account admin to continue using Devin.
translation.billing.increaseUserLimitReachedDescription	You have hit your per-user limit for available {{unit}} this billing cycle.
translation.billing.individualPlanMemberDescription	Your account is on an individual plan but you are not the organization owner. Ask your account admin to upgrade to a Teams plan so everyone gets access.
translation.billing.individualPlanOwnerDescription	Your account is on an individual plan but you are not the organization owner. Upgrade to a Teams plan to give everyone access.
